flowchart LR
  U[User question] --> G[guard_in]
  G --> C[classify]
  C --> P[plan]
  P --> Tools[MCP tools:\nsearch / logs / error / status / draft]
  Tools --> E[evidence assess]
  E -->|insufficient| Refuse[refuse]
  E -->|ok| Gen[generate answer]
  Gen --> V[verify / citations]
  V --> Draft{ticket draft?}
  Draft -->|yes| IRQ[interrupt: await approval]
  IRQ -->|admin approve| Resume[resume + Ticket MCP]
  IRQ -->|reject / return| Revise[revise or abort]
  Draft -->|no| Done[completed]
  Resume --> Done
